4.7 Environmental Conservation
The project integrated environmentally sustainable practices throughout implementation.
These included:
•	Proper disposal and composting of poultry manure.
•	Efficient water utilization.
•	Rainwater harvesting.
•	Proper drainage around the poultry unit.
•	Reduction of feed wastage.
•	Routine cleaning and sanitation.
•	Planting of trees around the poultry unit to improve the microclimate.
These practices promoted environmental conservation while improving poultry welfare.
